26. JOB STATE MACHINE
Permitted transitions:
CREATED → QUEUED

QUEUED → CLAIMED

CLAIMED → RUNNING

RUNNING → VALIDATING

RUNNING → COMPLETED

VALIDATING → COMPLETED

RUNNING → FAILED

VALIDATING → FAILED

QUEUED → CANCELLED

CLAIMED → CANCELLED

RUNNING → INVALIDATED
Invalid state transitions must be rejected.

27. CANCELLATION
A queued job may be cancelled.
A running job may receive a cancellation request.
Workers must periodically check cancellation state.
Cancellation shall not automatically reverse mutations that have already been committed.
Model rollback remains a separate revision operation.

28. MODEL JOB
A model job executes a domain command.
MODEL_COMMAND
Input:
command_id
project_id
revision_id
model_version_id
The worker passes the command to:
Project Model Service
The Project Model Service remains the authoritative boundary for model mutation.
The worker must never directly manipulate database tables outside defined domain services.

29. GEOMETRY JOB
A geometry job operates against a specific model version.
GEOMETRY_GENERATION
Input:
project_id
model_version_id
element_ids
geometry_version
The geometry worker generates or regenerates geometry.
Before committing the result, it verifies that the source model version remains valid.

30. GEOMETRY STALENESS PROTECTION
Every geometry job shall record:
project_id
model_version_id
element_id
geometry_version
If the model changes before geometry completion, the worker shall not silently promote stale geometry to current state.
The job may instead become:
INVALIDATED
and a replacement geometry job may be scheduled.

31. COMPLIANCE JOB
A compliance job executes against an immutable regulatory manifest.
COMPLIANCE_ANALYSIS
Input:
project_id
revision_id
model_version_id
code_manifest_id
The worker evaluates the project against the rules contained in the selected manifest.
The result becomes part of the validation and provenance chain.

32. VALIDATION JOB
VALIDATION_RUN
Input:
project_id
revision_id
model_version_id
code_manifest_id
validation_categories
The validation worker executes:
CODE
SPATIAL
ACCESSIBILITY
DOCUMENT
COORDINATION
as applicable.
Results are stored through the Validation Service.

33. DRAWING GENERATION JOB
DRAWING_GENERATION
