34. SHEET COMPOSITION JOB
SHEET_COMPOSITION
The sheet compositor assembles:
views
drawings
dimensions
annotations
notes
schedules
title blocks
revision information
onto the appropriate sheet template.
For architectural output, the initial supported paper configuration includes:
ARCH_D
