36. DOCUMENT HASH JOB
DOCUMENT_HASH
The hashing worker computes a cryptographic hash of the completed document package.
The hash becomes part of the package provenance record.
Example:
SHA-256
The exact algorithm may be configuration-driven, but SHA-256 is the initial implementation target.

37. PACKAGE VERIFICATION JOB
PACKAGE_VERIFICATION
The verification worker confirms:
document exists
expected files exist
file hashes match
revision matches
model version matches
code manifest matches
validation record exists
required drawings exist
required schedules exist
Only a successfully verified package may proceed to final acceptance.

38. PROJECT RECONSTRUCTION JOB
PROJECT_RECONSTRUCTION
This job reconstructs a project state from:
project_id
revision_id
model_version_id
The reconstruction system verifies that historical state can be recreated from the persisted model and revision records.
This directly implements the OneDraft reconstruction requirement.

39. REDLINE RESOLUTION JOB
REDLINE_RESOLUTION
The job consumes:
redline_id
revision_id
model_version_id
The worker passes the requested change through the Runtime Orchestrator and Project Model Service.
A redline cannot be marked:
RESOLVED
until the associated model operation has successfully completed and required validation has passed.

