  "project_id": "uuid",
  "revision_id": "uuid",
  "model_version_id": "uuid",
  "result": {},
  "metrics": {}
}
The result payload shall contain references rather than unnecessarily duplicating large computational objects.

41. JOB METRICS
Workers shall record execution metrics.
Initial metrics include:
queue_wait_ms
execution_ms
validation_ms
memory_usage
cpu_time
input_size
output_size
retry_count
Metrics support:
performance optimization
