Examples:
JOB_CREATED
JOB_CLAIMED
JOB_STARTED
JOB_RETRIED
JOB_FAILED
JOB_COMPLETED
JOB_CANCELLED
JOB_INVALIDATED
WORKER_FAILURE
WORKER_RECOVERY
The audit record must preserve the relationship between execution state and project state.

68. SECURITY BOUNDARY
Workers shall not receive unrestricted database credentials.
Workers interact through:
domain services
application services
controlled repositories
The execution layer therefore maintains the existing OneDraft security boundary:
ARIA
