model_version_id
operation
target_objects
parameters
constraints
validation_requirements
The Runtime Orchestrator converts that request into one or more jobs.

71. EXAMPLE ARIA EXECUTION
User request:
Move the rear bedroom wall 300 mm north while keeping the exterior envelope unchanged.
Aria determines:
MOVE_ELEMENT
The Runtime Orchestrator creates:
MODEL_COMMAND
which creates:
GEOMETRY_GENERATION
followed by:
VALIDATION_RUN
followed by:
DRAWING_GENERATION
if affected documentation requires regeneration.

